00:07:44.168 --> 00:07:56.983
<v Host>That's all for today. Seven crested ibis chicks are growing up healthy at Tama Zoo in Tokyo, part of Japan's long effort to bring this beautiful bird back. Thanks for listening, and see you tomorrow.

